vkfft-rs is a pure-Rust reimplementation derived from the design and algorithms of VkFFT.

Upstream project: https://github.com/DTolm/VkFFT
Initial porting baseline: 066a17c17068c0f11c9298d848c2976c71fad1c1 (VkFFT 1.3.4)
Original author: Dmitrii Tolmachev
Upstream license: MIT (see LICENSE)

Design reference:
Dmitrii Tolmachev, "VkFFT-A Performant, Cross-Platform and Open-Source GPU FFT Library",
IEEE Access, 2023, DOI 10.1109/ACCESS.2023.3242240.
